{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_title", "source_sha256": "f7a069a889b0c6ecadd0133eb13fac06407cd2a339bba2d42a71c1a62e274667", "ja": "指先が示すところ", "zh": "指尖指向的地方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82cfcecc4bd0fa8366b7276341ee5f7bec149eca61ac2df1b6be4c8fc66c4092", "ja": "センター公演のレッスンが順調に進む中、\n自分には何かが足りないと悩むエミリー。\nプロデューサーや仲間に背中を押され、\n自分が本当に目指したかったものに気づいた\nエミリーは、今できる最高の景色を目指す。", "zh": "Center公演的练习进行得很顺利，\n但艾蜜莉却觉得自己有所不足。\n而在制作人和伙伴们的鼓励下，\n艾蜜莉终于找到自己真正的目标，\n决定尽自己所能，追求最棒的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12e21555cdeecf08ce0f3687a28533c69308709f5abd6694d3f2013972234260", "ja": "（エミリーのセンター公演のレッスンが始まって、\n数日。ここまで、全てが順調に進んでいる……）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉的Center公演练习已经进行了好几天，\n目前一切的进展都非常顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "ada6a8cd6e3a84f29f75dc1e6dfdc68dbd723f002dffb9c6a6e6b0cb89938cf9", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、すごいねぇ。もう全部の\n振り付けを覚えちゃったなんて、驚いたべさ。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你好厉害呢，居然已经\n记住所有的舞步，太惊人了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "8bd90fadd60ef43350841a74d74d4f90de8b0c1df5db50e48c7d7f2c36bd7b57", "ja": "私なんて、なかなか覚えられなくて大変だったのに……\nさすがだね！", "zh": "不像我，总是记不起来，手忙脚乱的……\n真的很厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "ecd3219067c06d42742f0d4b4383ee844dca5c97f8ddd6b1ce846c6becf5fc1b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそう言っていただけて、とても光栄です。", "zh": "谢谢两位。\n可以听到你们这么说，我觉得非常光荣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "733aaefebb1aea5d1e876d1b664e548b7763825d2d3e347484c0ce505584afbb", "ja": "でも、舞の稽古がここまで円滑に進んだのは、\nみなさまが支援してくださったおかげです。", "zh": "不过，舞蹈的练习之所以能这么顺利，\n也是因为有各位在旁支援。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca546a5c37c1de34b763927ad85122ac6dca91fe8366928de2933cd26d986e97", "ja": "一番は、エミリーちゃんががんばってるからだと思う！\nこの調子なら、本番もうまくいきそうだね。", "zh": "我觉得主要还是因为艾蜜莉非常努力！\n看样子，正式登台时也没什么好担心的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac10b9dcc0581c5f45a0ebc9fb9204e0052656f54f36c1032ecc7cc8cf096838", "ja": "わたしも、とっても楽しみです！\n早く公演の日にならないかな……♪", "zh": "我也非常期待！\n真希望公演那天可以快点来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "5f9a1b18985436e5200f2bae958bc99ec59427c394427abc4ed4dd2026a2756c", "ja": "はい、私もです。……あの、仕掛け人さま。\n仕掛け人さまは、先ほどの稽古をどう思われましたか？", "zh": "嗯，我也是……请问策划执行人先生，\n您觉得刚才的练习状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b9b343510feaf9b0dffcd0bd736dcbe82947588e9f0e478b0ceb641077e681da", "ja": "うん、よかったよ。調整が必要なところはあるけど、\n公演までまだ時間もあるし、焦る事はないかな。", "zh": "嗯，很好喔，虽然有些地方要再修一下，\n但离公演还有时间，没什么好着急的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "6542c90807a08f302a15f9eceb8810085c6d9167bf6e3fa07ea9cc33a94af77e", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\n…………。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d96695e4e395bb6237eac0d9bb7695d366b4ddf6af1f01d727be5cbe39d577fc", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。\nあの、大丈夫……かな……？", "zh": "艾蜜莉，\n那个，你还好……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "6f743f37efe35c62837afe826fe0d7510442d0ddb6dd073011a3b0208efec51e", "ja": "え？　な、何がでしょうか？", "zh": "咦？怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "41ba0a5a11d81f4f2980a6d3d80c4cba81b45795cfbc9448104e4bdd459d7edf", "ja": "あ、わ、私の勘違いだったらごめんね！？\nちょっと、元気がないように見えたから……。", "zh": "啊，如、如果是我误会，那我先跟你说对不起！！\n感觉你好像有点没精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9dd255ded23e4834aacaed8a8456e7c7e2edbcf4e3fe6ae0bfe9358cc2cad213", "ja": "その……エミリーちゃん、本当は何か、\n気になってることがあるんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "那个……艾蜜莉，\n你是不是有什么挂心的事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1ad21ca4bcdfd660386e892581c4d961f772c44430b1f89ef0666934e408be6c", "ja": "エミリー、そうなのか？\nもしそうなら、遠慮しなくていいんだぞ。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，是这样吗？\n如果是的话，你别客气，直接说没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "4c37c3987d042bc33d6f63dc202b81a251ac00336951b744de7d04a454942597", "ja": "雪歩さん。仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "雪步、策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "d369332fdb096d57a35391b602ce7209f550d1701182731417bca01229ca24e9", "ja": "実は……今のまま稽古を進めていいのか、\nすこし、不安に思っています。", "zh": "老实说……我有点担心，\n不晓得自己这样练习下去是不是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "96f4e364d15dba0e85821706b0726b6fa7d7da73be04f1b46ea7e7eb5f39a0e6", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、こんなにできてるのに不安なのかい？\nレッスン、順調に進んでると思うんだけども……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你都已经表现得那么好了，还会担心吗？\n我倒觉得练习的状况挺顺利的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "d9c176d303ce36222bd376cc4dfd6a1046ba5994ec70157275d27b9589f08a8d", "ja": "ええ、稽古の進捗は順調です。ですが……\n主役公演をするには、何か足りない気がしてるんです。", "zh": "嗯，练习本身是很顺利没错，可是……\n我觉得自己要在公演上担任主角，还是缺了些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6f72be7eb99bfdf8bd6328a5a3de65705db1fce202a20e30028d72d3aa34bbc8", "ja": "何か足りない、か。\nたとえば、どんな事だろう？", "zh": "缺了些什么啊……\n举例来说，是哪方面呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "fc48ebed27dfc10add96b98b394c95f6fb1750687dfab35ae11aa40882ba48c6", "ja": "それが……なんだかふわふわしていて、\n私にも、うまく言葉にすることができないんです。", "zh": "这个嘛……我自己的感觉也很模糊，\n不晓得该怎么形容才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "936f5419d8891024817ccb995bb242a97ba04c78de28b71bd2df30a2ec6ce172", "ja": "私は、みなさんが主役公演で\n活躍する姿を、近くで見ていました。", "zh": "各位担任主角大显身手的公演，\n我一直以来都有幸就近观赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "35b47fd1ce60380bc23d2b99a5648126c1339f398b48cf4ba30eb122aa92b237", "ja": "その時のみなさんと、今の自分を比べると、\nやはり何かが足りなく思えてしまって……。", "zh": "我觉得现在的自己跟当时的各位比起来，\n还是缺了些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "a082b3038f2134a0145181882061c87a0e771bfd8465c39fde9473bb7276844a", "ja": "う～ん、なんだろか？　あたしはレッスンの\nとおりに、がんばっただけなんだけども……。", "zh": "嗯～会是什么呢？我自己就只是\n发挥练习的成果，努力演出而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "043e20d522834415e06e454eb861aeb4d418137fd1c5d0840b7e287407feb9aa", "ja": "わたしも、いつもみたいに、\n歌とダンスを一生懸命がんばっただけです。", "zh": "我也是，就是像平常那样，\n尽全力唱歌跳舞而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "384e24f9784e261a146322334dc3789d5051914e9e7a7490da7ad0d0e8f610d1", "ja": "そ、それなんです！　いつもどおりなんですけど、\nいつもどおりではない、すこし特別なもの……。", "zh": "重、重点就在这里！虽然跟平常一样，\n却又不同于以往，更特别一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "96566abddb909d3997db99a780b71c90b21b33536cc09dffda01a9146b5d5e23", "ja": "星梨花さんとひなたさんが披露されたような……\nそんなものを、私も、ごヒイキ様方に届けたいんです。", "zh": "如同星梨花和日向所展现的舞台……\n我也希望自己能让各位主顾看到那么精采的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "e62b51397fdcce1a43c37d0ec61a9e12d1a5b8ce8acb7c858d88c8c90a182bcd", "ja": "けど、私にとってのそれが何なのか……\n何をすればいいのか、見当もつきません……。", "zh": "可是，我却不清楚自己的特别之处在哪……\n完全不晓得到底该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "92feb68d0b1059fdb4ed39e89efb280137279f8f286b84dfcd96e701da725ed1", "ja": "いつもどおりだけど、すこし特別……。\n改めて言われると、なんだか難しいことかも……。", "zh": "跟平常一样，却又更特别一点……\n这样拿出来讨论，才发现好像挺有难度的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ec64aa0bbdc885015c2ccc0d9d1ffc579cfcca293ba2ffd5ef14b5576532ef3", "ja": "大丈夫です！　みんなで考えればきっと見つかります！\nそうですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "不用担心！大家一起动脑肯定会找到的！\n你说对不对，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f2b386fe8ca7fec9c9a96ff6203bb3dc4bc94d008df6ebf9b736626d45b56254", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\nみんな、エミリーに力を貸してあげてくれ。", "zh": "嗯，没错！\n那就麻烦大家协助艾蜜莉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "93714e2212127ea4d135f12ad1d49739b67a98892fe58ab2e882044a702bcfdb", "ja": "うん、あたし、がんばるよぉ。\nエミリーちゃん、一緒に考えようねぇ。", "zh": "嗯，我会加油哪。\n艾蜜莉，我们一起寻找解答吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "b04b836156818dbd7fa6cb61b857151553b74ea1a383ab3cf3eeb2fd1b15844e", "ja": "もちろんです！　エミリーちゃん。\n新しい自分に生まれ変わるのは、物語の定石だよ！", "zh": "这是当然的，艾蜜莉！\n让自己浴火重生可是写故事的最佳公式呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "348552077c6749f3316238c0332202d6f4a119137c133168bbd382a2b4843536", "ja": "みなさん……ありがとうございます！\nとても心強いです♪", "zh": "各位……谢谢你们！\n有你们在真让人安心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1235576b9c67f9cfca4257046b334cb93dd22e53a43f6c143f913816dab01de6", "ja": "それじゃまずは、基本的な事から考えてみようか。\nエミリーは、今回のステージを誰に届けたい？", "zh": "那我们先来思考几个基本问题吧。\n艾蜜莉，你想让谁看到这次的表演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "c595a070f03460f228d43ad540d1713beb8fcac94e92de414c457fa45bef8547", "ja": "それは、ごヒイキ様方ではないのですか？　みなさまに\nよろこんでいただくために、舞い歌うのだと……。", "zh": "应该就是各位主顾吧。\n我想尽力唱歌跳舞，让大家乐在其中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1036_035hin", "source_sha256": "1f438e0582cabb6082257caee831d60d1dafc49fbb512a387a2df7fc24dabb82", "ja": "でも、いつもどおりだと、\n何か足りないって話なんだよねぇ。難しいべさ。", "zh": "可是，如果跟平常一样，\n又会觉得有所不足是吧？这问题真难哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "10e03f8eda45fba0ca7021dc6dbb71dc74d4657e620f8c54888b226f729ccd6c", "ja": "いっそ、歌とダンスの他に、何か取り入れてみる？\n主人公が、新しい必殺技を習得するみたいに！", "zh": "还是干脆试着加入歌舞之外的要素？\n就好像故事里学会新绝招的主角一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1038_p", "source_sha256": "f2b4f8f38e00f8e2e126bc0e6cd64c529ce34c81ad6836068736c5a754d70d53", "ja": "それだと、いつもどおりじゃないな。ファンの人達は、\nどんなエミリーでも受け入れてくれるだろうけど……。", "zh": "那样的话，就会跟以往有不小落差呢。虽然我觉得\n不管是怎样的艾蜜莉，粉丝们都会接受，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f28ee5cf989a5fdd3fc31a1b54cdcd3b5506d42ddb0f9ee4615b053fd3bc2817", "ja": "そうじゃなくて、もっと単純に考えてみよう。\nみんなが、公演に何を求めて来るのか……。", "zh": "感觉答案不是这个，我们别想得太复杂。\n先好好思考观众来看公演是为了什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8f41146360f603652ae80116270cb756694dc97282ca6d8bab8ec0e96d8c6b3d", "ja": "それは……やっぱり、エミリーちゃんがセンターだし、\nエミリーちゃんのステージじゃないでしょうか？", "zh": "我想……毕竟艾蜜莉是Center，\n大家应该就是为了看艾蜜莉的表演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "256e8d0813ac56d21381de315d941f12a199a96d98c2236acdfbdb5af4ff35aa", "ja": "わたしもそう思います！　わたしがお客さんだったら、\n歌って踊るエミリーちゃんを、たくさん見たいです！", "zh": "我也这么觉得！如果我是观众，\n那我一定是来看小艾又唱又跳的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1042_p", "source_sha256": "ea4e1a5cb8f8c5d715bab7eeb6b4c0e70cdaa09ab145c5b0b6343efe6aac9f99", "ja": "俺も同じだ。エミリーの全部が詰まったステージを、\nお客さん達は見たいんだと思う。", "zh": "我也有同感。我想观众们来这里，\n就是为了看到艾蜜莉使出浑身解数的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a5b28f2973b795d4e3ce7c28c73964b788a6bbf0738c714d604cc12f2e0acbc5", "ja": "だから難しく考えないで……エミリーの理想のために、\nもう少しわがままになってもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "所以艾蜜莉，你别想得太复杂……为了你自己的理想，\n我觉得你可以再任性大胆一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "e5d453f7640ff06ea7e9c31d07e9bb7b933bf5cb8c09f20f391c6f0c2bfd875e", "ja": "で、ですが……私はもう、今回の主役公演について、\nいろいろな要望を出してしまっています。", "zh": "可、可是……这次的公演让我担任主角，\n我就已经提出不少要求了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "19720783458bfc0141a35519a4aabcb844f464fb5a71784ff365662a49f3688d", "ja": "大和撫子らしい、雅で奥ゆかしい舞台にしたいと。\nさらにわがままを言うなんて、ご迷惑では……。", "zh": "说希望舞台符合大和抚子的形象，展现典雅、端庄之美。\n要是再放纵任性的话，会给大家添麻烦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f27aa80d4394cbfba58f76e63230fad6f1b51fd7f79bd911610185e0d82fe11", "ja": "そんなこと、全然迷惑だなんて思わないよ！\nだってこれは、エミリーちゃんのステージだもん。", "zh": "这里才没有人会这么想呢！\n毕竟这是属于艾蜜莉的舞台啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1047_035hin", "source_sha256": "11c893dad6711bb1533622d8158331d66b1d37dbe28fd7c2f5860411e608ae2f", "ja": "うんうん、そうだべさ。エミリーちゃんが、\nやりたいようにやるのが一番だよぉ。", "zh": "嗯嗯，说得没错哪。\n让艾蜜莉自由发挥才是最棒的哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1048_p", "source_sha256": "d0915777d9d853164d9dccbb53ff88c161fd75d78cdb4ca081d1dbc117765ecf", "ja": "ほら、みんなこう言ってくれてるぞ。", "zh": "你看，大家都这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "17da2ce5071d586c1a0dcd97c8411d4dbfe5f2f5271579aa58069641a6a8c699", "ja": "で、ですが……。", "zh": "可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1050_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a19e23d13067e594d0ccf4587d320653db2f8cd781d4a5d260ac1a9237e61931", "ja": "{$P$}の言うこと、わかります。\nでも、エミリーちゃんの気持ちもわかるかも……。", "zh": "我明白{$P$}的意思。\n不过，我好像也能理解艾蜜莉的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "f0cb9c875887ae7dcce6df8b560e9bea216a965fe7e4c63bc1c7ff75a7f814c9", "ja": "雪歩さん、そうなんですか？", "zh": "雪步姊姊，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1052_004yuk", "source_sha256": "282eb823d74dbd0d7fd3f2051d8e941512ac5454ba891846a8867936d30ef1b2", "ja": "あ、ご、ごめんね！　私なんかが、偉そうに\nわかるだなんて言っちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，抱、抱歉！我这种人居然\n高高在上地说自己可以理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e516d352ce8548f667ac2e56e831e3219e12db9f242126c4b5d4ebc4d41e5581", "ja": "えっと、私も同じだったから。みんなが「大丈夫」って\n言ってくれても、なかなか踏み出せなくて……。", "zh": "那个，我之前也一样。虽然大家都跟我说\n「不用担心」，但自己还是迟迟跨不出那一步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1054_p", "source_sha256": "cfb21d4232519e33674ca5d3b6778d4c5fe98457aa5b9e1f0014da24be787a96", "ja": "……エミリーは、どんな大和撫子になりたいかって、\nみんなに伝えたのか？", "zh": "……艾蜜莉，你有告诉过大家\n你想成为怎样的大和抚子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "a3131d42abe36b433f206fa0458cb1f5d337b04124eb0e29d8fa55ed559d631d", "ja": "は、はい。貴音さまや紬さん、それに\n雪歩さんのような方が、理想の大和撫子だと……。", "zh": "有、有的，像贵音小姐、䌷姊姊\n还有雪步，就是我理想中的大和抚子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1056_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3f82995706e559ab02e8100bd312b18101f294df390fe49ff9f18aee6b6f16dd", "ja": "ええっ！？　あれって、そういう意味だったの！？\nも、もっと言い過ぎだよ……。", "zh": "咦咦！？原来那句话是这个意思！？\n也、也太看得起我了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1057_022ser", "source_sha256": "9521f0090646514a8b145c6b268bbcafb9c64e0a8989a4d8bedb4b5e1100abb6", "ja": "憧れてるって、言ってましたよね。エミリーちゃんの\nステージ、おふたりにも見てもらえたらいいですね！", "zh": "我记得小艾有说觉得很向往她们对吧，\n真希望到时也能让她们俩看看你的表演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "3eeaa636544b1b5297f7a773eb81d85de2d794ec64eb2dc4fcaf6d4d3017efae", "ja": "貴音さまと、紬さんに？", "zh": "你说让贵音小姐和䌷姊姊看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "b93c1e4515ab90b2ae923909594806656eba1d31951c276296ba1434bc5987fd", "ja": "まぁ、どうしましょう！？　おふたりに\n見せるには、今のままでは雅さが足りません！", "zh": "哎呀，这怎么行！要给她们两位看的话，\n现在这样还不够典雅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1060_032emi", "source_sha256": "18094e1ae50d5a26ef94eeeb3be800133b41ee2feee272e6852be6dd968fd702", "ja": "そんな中途半端な舞台をお届けしては、\nきっと、ごヒイキ様方にも気づかれてしまいます！", "zh": "如果在舞台上拿出这种不上不下的表现，\n那各位主顾肯定也会发觉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1061_p", "source_sha256": "56d6ffda180b4286d5f910ff9d84594de7658fde88469b8387bc6e961fad9ac3", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nそれなら、エミリーはどうすればいいと思う？", "zh": "嗯，说得对。\n既然这样，艾蜜莉你觉得该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1062_032emi", "source_sha256": "166b5eecf21e2522e1aedfe1c6c4af4b77e94ba59ce048a151e01132e41e834d", "ja": "私は……この主役公演を、貴音さまや紬さんに\n胸を張って見せられるようになりたいです！", "zh": "我……希望可以抬头挺胸、充满信心地\n让贵音小姐和䌷姊姊来看这场由我担任主角的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1063_032emi", "source_sha256": "db7001d57dad790414c593bd8efeaf630dfc52383620fd1b4aa9687e300d82ea", "ja": "振り付けを覚えただけでは、足りなかったんです。\n私の理想の大和撫子そのままに、舞い踊るには……。", "zh": "光记住舞步还不够。\n如果要像我理想中的大和抚子那样翩翩起舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1064_032emi", "source_sha256": "59f84d354d2ee285f3b9e9ea8fad3a4d6319130e42011f4e3bf0be991d92c083", "ja": "今の私では、まだまだ足りません。\nどうか、みなさんのお力を貸していただけませんか？", "zh": "我现在的程度还远远不足。\n可否拜托各位助我一臂之力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_040_1065_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
